# 5. Research Lifecycle

The workflow should be configurable by administrators.

```
Research Creation
        ↓
Topic Proposal
        ↓
Supervisor Assignment
        ↓
Topic Approval
        ↓
Proposal Writing
        ↓
Research Writing
        ↓
AI Validation
        ↓
Supervisor Review
        ↓
Corrections
        ↓
Final Approval
        ↓
Department Approval
        ↓
Archive
        ↓
Optional Publication to Knowledge Hub
```

Each stage should support configurable permissions, notifications, deadlines, and approval requirements.

